Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:49.93,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Open core: the kernel is
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:49.93,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}open, the cloud stays closed
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:49.93,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}for security”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,We're open core and what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:01.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,that means is like we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:02.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,have a kernel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,first of all we started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the kernel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,we built that first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,it was a signal for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,people of like the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,technical prowess of us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:10.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,because you know we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,systems researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know it's a mix of C
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,and assembly so it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,know much harder to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,and so it was kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,for folks like okay this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,is a badge these guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:20.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,know what they're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's still true
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:24.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the kernel's there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,we built now around it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a cloud platform
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,that can use this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:28.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,it can also use Linux
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,it can use Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,So you can use it as a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:33.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,traditional
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:34.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,fast-performing cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:36.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,but for us there's the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:37.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,question of actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:37.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,security.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a guard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's an API endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,And if everything else
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,was open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,people could just dive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,in and potentially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,compromise our cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,platform or the cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:48.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,platform of our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:49.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,customers as well.
